=== AC1: source scripts/app-nav/uinav.sh directly in ZSH (not bash -c), call ui_find with --exact against a 2+ match label ===
$ zsh -c 'source scripts/app-nav/uinav.sh && ui_find "Order status, Delivered" --exact'
