  label="Order status, Delivered"  clickable=true  area=574056  at 672,2685
  label="Order status, Delivered"  clickable=true  area=793152  at 672,1479
  label="Order status, Delivered"  clickable=true  area=793152  at 672,2127
exit=3
-> No usage-line fallback. Correct AMBIGUOUS (exit 3).

=== AC1 continued: ui_tap under zsh direct-source with --first, vs bash -c baseline for the SAME target ===
$ bash -c 'source scripts/app-nav/uinav.sh && ui_tap "Order status, Delivered" --first'
tap 'Order status, Delivered' @ 672 2685
